</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/dfdb9af1-f0d3-4487-8447-c951ed739ac9_904/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/dfdb9af1-f0d3-4487-8447-c951ed739ac9_904/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1781959550652_7565" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1781959550652_7565"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">
  
  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>Founders, investors, operators. Two days in Lisbon.</strong></p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Meet the people building, backing, and shaping what comes next in Europe's startup ecosystem.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>Startup Summit Lisbon 2026 brings founders, investors, operators, startup teams, and future builders together for two days of ideas, capital, talent, visibility, and opportunity in Lisbon.</strong></p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Startup Summit Lisbon is the premier convergence point for the European tech ecosystem. Not a passive trade show — a high-stakes platform where ambitious founders, tier-1 capital allocators and enterprise executives collide to fund, scale and dominate the global market.</p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>2,000+ Target attendees: </strong>A curated, compact community of founders, investors, operators and ecosystem partners — quality over scale.</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>Investors, angels &amp; VC funds:</strong> A focused investor audience across Pre-seed to Series A/B, with structured founder-investor matchmaking.</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>200+ Startup booths planned:</strong> Europe’s next generation of pre-vetted, early-stage startups exhibiting and pitching.</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>150+ World-class speakers:</strong> Actionable insights, raw metrics and uncensored case studies from practitioners who have built and exited companies.</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>40+ Countries represented: </strong>A truly international community bridging Europe, the Nordics and the US East Coast.</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>2 Specialized stages:</strong> Immersive content tracks and masterclasses optimized for fundraising, venture capital and deep tech.</p></li></ul><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Happening on September 17–18, 2026 at Unicorn Factory – Beato Innovation District, the Summit is designed for people building, backing, scaling, hiring, or exploring what comes next in the startup ecosystem.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Across the two days, attendees can expect startup-focused content, speaker sessions, investor and founder networking, startup booths, side events, and conversations designed to move ideas forward.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Whether you are building a company, investing in early-stage ideas, scaling a team, looking for your next opportunity, or trying to get your idea out of your head and into the room, Startup Summit Lisbon is where the ecosystem comes together.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>What to expect:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">2 days of startup-focused content</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Founders, investors, operators, and startup teams in one place</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Speaker sessions and ecosystem conversations</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Startup booths and visibility opportunities</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Networking moments designed for real connections</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Lisbon as the meeting point for Europe’s startup community</p></li></ul><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Join Lisbon on September 17–18, 2026.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black"><strong><em>Thanks to </em></strong></span><a target="_blank" href="https://startupsummit.io/"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black"><strong><em>Startup Summit</em></strong></span></a><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black"><strong><em> for sharing these graphics and details with</em></strong></span><a target="_blank" href="http://startupevents.org/"><strong><u><em>StartupEvents.org</em></u></strong></a><strong><em> and our worldwide audience.</em></strong></p></div>


  
